  <diagram id="XgHYAbM0MhzQAeiVvnse" name="Sequence diagram — Get My Signing Key">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant UI as Client Page\n    participant API as digitalSignatureService\n    participant C as SignatureController\n    participant CU as CurrentUser\n    participant KR as UserKeysRepository\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Yêu cầu xem signing key\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: getMyKey()\n    API-&gt;&gt;C: GET /api/v1/signature/keys/me\n    C-&gt;&gt;CU: getCurrentUser()\n    CU--&gt;&gt;C: Authenticated Users\n    C-&gt;&gt;KR: findByUserId(userId)\n    KR-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT user_key BY userId\n    DB--&gt;&gt;KR: UserKeys hoặc empty\n\n    alt Có key\n        KR--&gt;&gt;C: UserKeys\n        C-&gt;&gt;C: toResponse(key)\n        Note over C: Private key và certificate không được trả ở API này\n        C--&gt;&gt;API: 200 available=true và public key info\n    else Chưa có key\n        KR--&gt;&gt;C: Optional empty\n        C--&gt;&gt;API: 200 available=false\n    end\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: UserKeyInfoResponse\n    UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị trạng thái signing key&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="W6XR_FNnG1HI6B7V4LBP-1">
