  <diagram id="LNls_J8GCC2UunckHXfC" name="Sequence diagram — Sign Contract bằng PAdES">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant UI as ContractSigningPage\n    participant API as contractApi\n    participant C as PadesController\n    participant S as PadesSigningService\n    participant CU as CurrentUser\n    participant CR as ContractRepository\n    participant ESR as ElectronicSignatureRepository\n    participant Cloud as CloudinaryService\n    participant Crypto as Browser Web Crypto\n    participant KR as UserKeysRepository\n    participant PV as PadesVerificationService\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Chọn mẫu chữ ký và vị trí trên PDF\n    UI-&gt;&gt;UI: Giải mã private key bằng PIN\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: preparePadesSigning(contractId, signatureId, keyCode, PDF, position)\n    API-&gt;&gt;C: POST /api/v1/contracts/{contractId}/sign/prepare\n    C-&gt;&gt;CU: getCurrentUser()\n    CU--&gt;&gt;C: Authenticated Users\n    C-&gt;&gt;CR: findById(contractId)\n    CR-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT contract\n    DB--&gt;&gt;CR: Contracts\n    CR--&gt;&gt;C: Contracts\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: prepare(..., pdfBytes)\n    S-&gt;&gt;ESR: findById(electronicSignatureId)\n    ESR-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT electronic signature image\n    DB--&gt;&gt;ESR: ElectronicSignatures\n    ESR--&gt;&gt;S: ElectronicSignatures\n    S-&gt;&gt;Cloud: Download signature image\n    Cloud--&gt;&gt;S: Image bytes\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: Vẽ ảnh, tạo PDF placeholder, contentToSign và session\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: PadesPrepareResponse\n    C--&gt;&gt;API: 200 sessionId, contentToSign, documentHash, keyCode\n    API--&gt;&gt;UI: Prepare data\n\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Crypto: RSA sign(contentToSign, privateKey)\n    Crypto--&gt;&gt;UI: signatureValue Base64\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: completePadesSigning(contractId, sessionId, signatureValue)\n    API-&gt;&gt;C: POST /api/v1/contracts/{contractId}/sign/complete\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: getSession(sessionId)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: PadesSigningSession\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: Kiểm tra session.contractId\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: complete(sessionId, signatureValue)\n    S-&gt;&gt;KR: findByUserIdAndKeyCode(userId, keyCode)\n    KR-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT user key\n    DB--&gt;&gt;KR: UserKeys\n    KR--&gt;&gt;S: UserKeys và certificate\n    S-&gt;&gt;PV: verifyAll(originalPdf)\n    PV--&gt;&gt;S: Existing signature results\n\n    alt Có chữ ký PAdES cũ không hợp lệ\n        S--&gt;&gt;C: Reject signing\n        C--&gt;&gt;API: Error response\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Error\n        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị lỗi chữ ký cũ\n    else Các chữ ký cũ hợp lệ\n        S-&gt;&gt;S: Verify browser RSA signature\n        S-&gt;&gt;S: Tạo CMS và nhúng vào PDF\n        S-&gt;&gt;CU: getCurrentUser()\n        CU--&gt;&gt;S: Current Users\n        S-&gt;&gt;Cloud: uploadPdfAndSave(signedPdf)\n        Cloud-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT FileStorage\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Cloud: New FileStorage\n        Cloud--&gt;&gt;S: FileStorage\n        S-&gt;&gt;CR: save(contract với documentFile và hash mới)\n        CR-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE contract\n        DB--&gt;&gt;CR: Updated contract\n        S-&gt;&gt;S: Xóa signing session\n        S--&gt;&gt;C: signedPdf bytes\n        C--&gt;&gt;API: 200 PDF Base64\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Signed PDF\n        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị ký thành công\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ShPb6WsXY5FOcVYFBrK_-1">
