        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant UI as LoginForm\n    participant API as authenService\n    participant C as AuthenticateController\n    participant AM as AuthenticationManager\n    participant UDS as UserDetailService\n    participant UR as UserRepository\n    participant DB as Database\n    participant PE as PasswordEncoder\n    participant JWT as JWTService\n    participant KR as UserKeysRepository\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;UI: Nhập email và password\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: login(email, password)\n    API-&gt;&gt;C: POST /api/v1/auth/login\n    C-&gt;&gt;AM: authenticate(email, password)\n    AM-&gt;&gt;UDS: loadUserByUsername(email)\n    UDS-&gt;&gt;UR: findByEmail(email)\n    UR-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT user và roles\n    DB--&gt;&gt;UR: Users\n    UR--&gt;&gt;UDS: Optional Users\n\n    alt Không tìm thấy tài khoản\n        UDS--&gt;&gt;AM: UsernameNotFoundException\n        AM--&gt;&gt;C: AuthenticationException\n        C--&gt;&gt;API: 401 Email or password is incorrect\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Error\n        UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị lỗi đăng nhập\n    else Tìm thấy tài khoản\n        UDS--&gt;&gt;AM: MyUserDetail\n        AM-&gt;&gt;PE: matches(rawPassword, encodedPassword)\n        alt Password không đúng\n            PE--&gt;&gt;AM: false\n            AM--&gt;&gt;C: AuthenticationException\n            C--&gt;&gt;API: 401 Email or password is incorrect\n            API--&gt;&gt;UI: Error\n            UI--&gt;&gt;User: Hiển thị lỗi đăng nhập\n        else Password đúng\n            PE--&gt;&gt;AM: true\n            AM--&gt;&gt;C: Authentication principal\n            C-&gt;&gt;JWT: generateToken(MyUserDetail)\n            JWT--&gt;&gt;C: JWT token\n            C-&gt;&gt;C: primaryRoleName(users)\n            C-&gt;&gt;KR: existsAllByKeyStatus(userId, ACTIVE)\n            KR-&gt;&gt;DB: Kiểm tra khóa chữ ký ACTIVE\n            DB--&gt;&gt;KR: true hoặc false\n            KR--&gt;&gt;C: hasSignatureKey\n            C--&gt;&gt;API: 201 AuthenticateResponse\n            API--&gt;&gt;UI: token, role, fullName, departmentName, hasSignatureKey\n            UI-&gt;&gt;UI: Lưu dữ liệu vào localStorage\n            alt Chưa có signing key\n                UI--&gt;&gt;User: Điều hướng trang tạo signature\n            else Đã có signing key\n                UI--&gt;&gt;User: Điều hướng trang chủ\n            end\n        end\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="R0ZXsMjd7IlnjhZrXwqs-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
